 sequenceDiagram
      actor Patient
      participant Appointments as Appointments Module
      participant OpenMRS
      participant SMS as SMS Service
      participant Provider as External SMS Provider

      Patient->>Appointments: Book appointment
      Appointments->>OpenMRS: POST appointment

      SMS->>OpenMRS: Poll — GET upcoming appointments
      OpenMRS-->>SMS: Appointment + patient phone data
      SMS->>Provider: HTTPS POST — send SMS
      Provider-->>Patient: SMS notification